@using IsaChatApp.Services.Presentation
@* ============================================================
   PromiseFlow.razor -- September's diagram, redrawn and animated (November 16, 2026).

   Used by the "diagram" slides in Present.razor:
   - Slide 7 (Kept = false): "What we promised in September". A blue dot, the question,
     goes through the system in four runs: search first, when search isn't enough, another
     language (Translation is a side path), and talk to a person.
   - Slide 16 (Kept = true): the same diagram, then it transforms into a status rail. The
     status and "built" wording come from the slide's items in presentation/slides.json,
     matched by each item's "name"; nothing about status is typed here.
   The part names, notes and the four captions on slide 7 are in this file (the SVG) and
   in PromiseFlow.razor.js. Replay: R, or click the diagram. Motion respects
   "reduce motion". Sizes are in cqw of the stage, so it scales with the slide.
   ============================================================ *@
